{"seq":1,"slug":"temperature-coldchain","title":"温度控制与冷链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-safety-microbiology/control/temperature-coldchain","wordCount":1933,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"温度控制与冷链\">温度控制与冷链</h1><p>把一锅热汤从灶上端下来放凉过夜，看似稀松平常，却可能是一次完美的&quot;细菌培养实验&quot;：汤温缓缓滑过 50 ℃、40 ℃、30 ℃，每一个温度都恰好是某类致病菌的舒适区，而缓慢降温让它们获得了数小时的繁殖窗口。温度是食品安全里最强大、也最容易操作的控制变量——前面<a href=\"../microbiology/growth-factors\">微生物生长与影响因素</a>讲过它如何决定生长速率，本篇把这条原理转化为工程实践：危险温度带、加热杀灭的定量规律，以及把低温从农田延续到餐桌的冷链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>温度控制有两个方向：用低温把微生物摁在迟滞期（冷藏、冷冻），或用高温把它们杀灭（巴氏杀菌、商业灭菌）。介于二者之间的 5–60 ℃ 是&quot;危险温度带&quot;，致病菌在此区间快速繁殖，食品在此累计停留越久越危险。冷链（cold chain）则是把低温控制贯穿生产、贮存、运输、零售、消费全过程的无缝温度管理系统——任何一环断裂都可能让前功尽弃。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[温度控制策略] --&gt; B[低温: 抑制]&#10;    A --&gt; C[高温: 杀灭]&#10;    A --&gt; D[危险温度带&lt;br/&gt;5-60 摄氏度]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[冷藏 0-4 摄氏度]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[冷冻 -18 摄氏度]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[巴氏杀菌&lt;br/&gt;杀致病菌]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[商业灭菌&lt;br/&gt;杀芽孢]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[快速通过&lt;br/&gt;降温/升温]&#10;    B1 --&gt; E[冷链贯穿全程]&#10;    B2 --&gt; E&#10;    D1 --&gt; F[累计不超 4 小时]\">flowchart TD\n    A[温度控制策略] --&gt; B[低温: 抑制]\n    A --&gt; C[高温: 杀灭]\n    A --&gt; D[危险温度带&lt;br/&gt;5-60 摄氏度]\n    B --&gt; B1[冷藏 0-4 摄氏度]\n    B --&gt; B2[冷冻 -18 摄氏度]\n    C --&gt; C1[巴氏杀菌&lt;br/&gt;杀致病菌]\n    C --&gt; C2[商业灭菌&lt;br/&gt;杀芽孢]\n    D --&gt; D1[快速通过&lt;br/&gt;降温/升温]\n    B1 --&gt; E[冷链贯穿全程]\n    B2 --&gt; E\n    D1 --&gt; F[累计不超 4 小时]</pre><p>危险温度带的边界各国略有差异，下表对照常见标准——温度阈值的微生物学根据在<a href=\"../microbiology/growth-factors\">微生物生长与影响因素</a>，本篇关注其操作执行。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>温度区间</th>\n<th>微生物状态</th>\n<th>操作要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> ℃（热保持）</td>\n<td>不能繁殖</td>\n<td>热食保持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> ℃（美标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>57</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 57</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">57</span></span></span></span></span> ℃/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>135</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">135</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">135</span></span></span></span></span>℉）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> ℃（危险带）</td>\n<td>快速繁殖</td>\n<td>累计停留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> ℃（冷藏）</td>\n<td>嗜温菌休眠、耐冷菌缓慢</td>\n<td>冷藏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> ℃（美标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>℃/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>41</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">41</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">41</span></span></span></span></span>℉）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le -18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">18</span></span></span></span></span> ℃（冷冻）</td>\n<td>完全停止</td>\n<td>长期贮存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"危险温度带与时间-温度法则\">危险温度带与时间-温度法则</h2><p>危险温度带的本质是&quot;细菌的最适生长区与人类舒适温度高度重叠&quot;。多数食源致病菌在 35 ℃ 附近世代时间最短（约 20 分钟），因此食品在危险带停留的时间必须严格限制。国际通行的经验法则是：食品在 5–60 ℃ 累计停留不超过 4 小时——注意是&quot;累计&quot;，从原料接收、加工、待售到食用各环节的危险带时间要相加。</p>\n<p>这条法则有其动力学根据。结合第一章的指数增长模型，初始 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个细菌在世代时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 下经时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 后达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = N_0 \\cdot 2^{t/g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g=20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 小时，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>4096</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N/N_0 = 2^{12} \\approx 4096</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4096</span></span></span></span></span> 倍——这个增幅对多数初始低污染食品仍在安全边缘，超过则风险陡升。因此两个高风险操作必须特别警惕：熟食冷却（必须快速穿过危险带，常规要求如 60 ℃→21 ℃ 不超过 2 小时、21 ℃→5 ℃ 再不超过 4 小时）和冷藏食品复热（要快速升温至 ≥74 ℃）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"加热杀灭的定量-d-值与-z-值\">加热杀灭的定量：D 值与 z 值</h2><p>加热杀菌不是&quot;达到某温度就瞬间无菌&quot;，而是遵循对数死亡规律——在恒定致死温度下，微生物数量随时间呈指数下降。描述这一规律的核心参数是 D 值（decimal reduction time）：在特定温度下使微生物数量减少 90%（一个对数级）所需的时间。D 值越大，该菌越耐热。</p>\n<p>不同温度下的 D 值由 z 值联系起来：z 值是使 D 值变化 10 倍（一个对数级）所需的温度变化。两者关系可写为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mi>z</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log \\frac{D_1}{D_2} = \\frac{T_2 - T_1}{z}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这套参数让杀菌工艺得以定量设计。例如低酸罐头的&quot;商业灭菌&quot;以杀灭肉毒梭菌芽孢为目标，采用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 值（以 121.1 ℃、z=10 ℃ 为基准的等效杀菌时间）作为指标，经典的&quot;12D 概念&quot;要求把肉毒梭菌芽孢降低 12 个对数级，确保万无一失。巴氏杀菌则只需杀灭营养体致病菌（如牛奶杀灭结核杆菌、Q 热立克次体），温度时间组合温和得多。肉毒梭菌的生物学特性见<a href=\"../microbiology/pathogens-spoilage\">致病菌与腐败菌</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>杀菌等级</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>典型条件</th>\n<th>残留微生物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>巴氏杀菌</td>\n<td>营养体致病菌</td>\n<td>牛奶 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>72</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">72</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span></span></span></span></span> ℃/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 秒（HTST）</td>\n<td>芽孢、部分耐热菌存活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商业灭菌</td>\n<td>肉毒梭菌芽孢</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>121</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">121</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">121</span></span></span></span></span> ℃ 高压、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0 \\ge 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>商业无菌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超高温（UHT）</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>135</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">135</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">135</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span></span> ℃/几秒</td>\n<td>商业无菌、可常温贮存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"冷藏与冷冻-抑制而非杀灭\">冷藏与冷冻：抑制而非杀灭</h2><p>低温控制的根本认知是：它抑制而不杀灭微生物。冷藏（0–4 ℃）把嗜温致病菌摁进迟滞期，但耐冷菌（最典型的单核细胞增生李斯特菌，见<a href=\"../microbiology/pathogens-spoilage\">致病菌与腐败菌</a>）仍能缓慢繁殖，这就是冷藏食品仍有保质期、且即食冷藏食品需限制货架期的根源。冷冻（≤-18 ℃）则让水分结冰、自由水消失，微生物完全停止繁殖——但解冻后存活的微生物会立即恢复活力，因此&quot;解冻后不可再冷冻&quot;，且解冻应在冷藏温度下缓慢进行，避免表面进入危险带。</p>\n<p>冷藏管理的常见失误集中在几处：冰箱过度堆放导致冷气不循环、频繁开门、温度设定偏高、未定期校准温度计。值得注意的是，冷冻虽不杀灭多数微生物，却是杀灭水产寄生虫（如异尖线虫）的法定手段——这一例外见<a href=\"../microbiology/virus-parasite-toxin\">病毒寄生虫与毒素</a>。低温与水分活度的协同（冷冻本质上也降低了可用水）正是栅栏技术的体现，详见<a href=\"water-activity-ph-hurdle\">水分活度与栅栏技术</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冷链-从农田到餐桌的无缝低温\">冷链：从农田到餐桌的无缝低温</h2><p>冷链是把低温控制延伸到食品全生命周期的系统工程，它的价值在于&quot;链&quot;——任何一环断裂，整条链的努力都付诸东流。一批冷藏即食食品即便在工厂控温完美，若运输车制冷故障、或在零售货架待售时温度超标、或消费者购物后在车里放了两小时，都可能让李斯特菌获得繁殖机会。因此冷链管理的核心是全程温度监控与可追溯。</p>\n<p>现代冷链大量采用时间-温度指示器（TTI）、物联网温度传感器和数据记录仪（data logger），对运输和贮存全程温度做连续记录，一旦超出阈值即报警。这些温度数据本身就是<a href=\"../systems/gmp-traceability\">GMP 与可追溯</a>中追溯链条的关键证据，也是发生问题时界定责任和判断食品是否仍安全的依据。冷链断裂的判断不能只看&quot;现在温度对不对&quot;，而要看&quot;累计在危险带停留了多久&quot;——这又回到了时间-温度法则。温度监控点往往是 HACCP 中的关键控制点，见<a href=\"../systems/haccp\">HACCP 危害分析</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>温度有两个控制方向：低温抑制（冷藏冷冻）与高温杀灭（巴氏/商业灭菌），5–60 ℃ 危险温度带必须快速通过。</li>\n<li>时间-温度法则要求危险带累计停留不超 4 小时；熟食冷却和复热是两个高风险操作，须快速穿越危险带。</li>\n<li>加热杀灭遵循对数死亡规律，由 D 值（降一个对数级所需时间）和 z 值定量描述；低酸罐头用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 值和 12D 概念确保杀灭肉毒梭菌芽孢。</li>\n<li>低温只抑制不杀灭：冷藏挡不住耐冷的李斯特菌，冷冻停止繁殖但解冻后复活，冷冻是杀水产寄生虫的法定例外。</li>\n<li>冷链贵在全程无缝，靠连续温度监控与数据记录；冷链断裂看累计危险带时间，温度数据是追溯与责任界定的关键证据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"温度控制与冷链","id":"温度控制与冷链"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"危险温度带与时间-温度法则","id":"危险温度带与时间-温度法则"},{"level":2,"text":"加热杀灭的定量：D 值与 z 值","id":"加热杀灭的定量-d-值与-z-值"},{"level":2,"text":"冷藏与冷冻：抑制而非杀灭","id":"冷藏与冷冻-抑制而非杀灭"},{"level":2,"text":"冷链：从农田到餐桌的无缝低温","id":"冷链-从农田到餐桌的无缝低温"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"物理性危害与过敏原","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-safety-microbiology/hazards/physical-allergen"},"next":{"title":"水分活度与栅栏技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-safety-microbiology/control/water-activity-ph-hurdle"}}